## Decisions Made
- **gpt-5.5 over Opus for Polina (q6a)** — Opus too expensive ($0.5/call) even hardened; gpt-5.5 = "optimal" quality + far cheaper/token + reasoning=none works. Revert = `CONCIERGE_PROVIDER=anthropic`.
- **Loop fix is model-agnostic** — W1/W3 stay regardless of model; the breaker is the durable backstop.
- **Concierge cost → budget_log with episode_id but NOT episodes.budget_spent** — per-episode "estimate" queryable without tripping pipeline gates (Director "хотя бы порядок, после отладки").
- **EREF dedup at factory Step-0, all principals, fail-open** — concurrency correctness ≠ autonomy cap; only blocks simultaneous dup; sequential/Director regen + Designer→Artist preserved.
- **Deferred**: single-approved-plan invariant (two APPROVED plans per shot coexist); W4.b tool-allowlist; W4.c prompt reorder; native Anthropic cache; interactive cost-record + episode-budget UI.

